<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-cooke-clock-and-wavefront-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Cooke & Zeeman (1976) clock-and-wavefront somite segmentation — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Cooke & Zeeman's (1976) Sections 2-5 kinematic laws (S = v * T_c, N = L / (v * T_c)) and Thom-Zeeman cusp catastrophe ODE tau_chi * dchi/dt = -(chi^3 - a(x,t)*chi - b_osc(x,t)) with irreversible post-wavefront commitment mobility (L88-246), reproducing S_sim = 100.13 um (0.13% error vs analytical 100.0 um) and exact N_norm = N_mini = 40 size invariance, verified by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_021_clock_and_wavefront.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
